## Codex-Specific Rules

These rules apply only when a Codex instruction file is loaded. Keep provider-neutral personal behavior in
`~/.local/share/chezmoi/.chezmoitemplates/personal-rules.md.tmpl`.

- Use `$github-cli-sandbox` before authenticated or networked GitHub CLI work. On this machine, sandboxed `gh`
  commands can report stale or invalid auth even when the real environment is authenticated.
